6	/**
7	 * Event cost items (#213) — the universal money catalog. GET lists an event's
8	 * items (any member; UI gates the breakdown to admins). POST creates a manual
9	 * item (admins). Auto items (contest/side-game buy-ins) are created by their
10	 * source, not here.
11	 */
12	
